WEBVTT

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.070
Halt!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.350
Who's following me, and where are you from?

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.910
Oh, man.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.670
So many guys surrounding just one girl?

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.270
You're all so lame.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.580
Hey! Princess!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.880
Umm, no... You look like her, but...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:37.590
Thank you!

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:42.060
O passing hero of justice, thank you so much for rescuing me!

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:42.970
Bye then!

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:46.350
...but your actions don't!

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.250
That's why I called you guys lame!

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:11.000
That damned Seiga!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.250
That sarcastic, bossy, evil, brutal, self-important bastard!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.380
Take this! And that!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.480
Like this again! Take this, this, this, this, this, this...!

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.900
If I were still in active service, I'd have gone pale with fright.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:23.760
Huh?

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.010
Oh, nothing.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.490
It's incredible,

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:28.670
the "Seiga effect."

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:32.770
I just feel that oujo-sama's character is degrading.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.800
She's better off the way she is now.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.050
If she can't even get angry, she's lost.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.650
Hoachoo!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:48.720
"Hoachoo"? Nobody says that nowadays.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.570
Master, I don't think that's what you should be worrying about.

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:53.890
Are you sure she's better off like this?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:57.090
Seiran, don't underestimate me.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:02.440
I'm fully confident that I can love my daughter, regardless of how she turns out.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:07.390
I never thought that the day would come when I'd find oujo-sama scary.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.600
I feel so much better!

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:21.150
Now let's go and work hard again today!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.660
How unusual, Vice Minister of Arms Mou.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.120
What is your concern today?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.710
Director General Ki, perhaps you know about this already.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:40.670
A gang of assassins has been gaining power recently in various districts.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.660
Since His Highness announced that he would take only one wife,

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:48.060
the peace and order of this country has begun to suffer.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.670
I too have a daughter.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:56.310
Any noble family would like to see their daughter in the Imperial Residence.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.560
I have discovered some information.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:02.820
Please make use of it.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:09.830
I fear the princess of the Ran family is in danger.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.050
I'm a sun-colored spongy omelet?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.110
You say the same thing as Setsuna-san.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.660
That's Souyouren.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:24.790
It's the dance of a love that's forever unrequited.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.500
Who is it?!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.640
What's wrong?

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.580
Are you upset about something?

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.130
P-Please don't look!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.440
The fan caught it when I threw it at you.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:55.880
I'm sorry.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:03.180
I'd kill myself for her, yet I can't stand to see her so happy.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:06.520
It pains me and makes my heart bleed.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.750
Does it?

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:09.680
I'd be happy.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:12.250
It's much better than to see someone racked by sorrow.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:13.550
That's sophistry.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.200
I'm not happy at all.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.140
You must've had a fortunate life.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.050
So fortunate that you take a hundredweight of happiness for granted.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.570
I love him. I love him more than anyone else.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.010
I never had anything in my life.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.050
That's why loving him is enough to make me happy.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.510
I can't think like you.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.650
That's why I'm running away.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.560
I'll continue to run.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.440
Why not?

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:47.640
Everyone's different.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.000
One day... this noise will stop.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.800
Before that day comes...

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.200
while I am still... who I am...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.560
with my own hands... I'll put an end to this.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.210
Shusui, are you there?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.350
Will you keep me company for a while?

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.380
Shusui?

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:38.830
Shusui, you're there, aren't you?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.080
May I come in?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.580
A-Are you angry at me about something?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.110
Just for a little while...

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.820
For a little longer...

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.780
My apologies, Your Highness, I was about to op-

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.430
Actually, I brought someone with me today.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.560
He's called Riou.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:38.490
Whoa, you made a lot again today.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:42.140
You must've really had an urge to smack something, right?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.870
Tan-tan, it's not lunchtime yet.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.620
Oh.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.600
Hey, Seiga! Who said you could eat them?

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.810
I didn't make them for you.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:53.990
What are you saying?

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:55.630
You made these while thinking of me, didn't you?

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.280
That damned Seiga!

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:04.290
Oh, I see, you've even checked on how I make dinner, have you?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.670
Of course.

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:10.230
By the way, you should show respect to your senior and call me "Seiga-sama."

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.670
Th-They're super scary.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.550
Enough chit-chat.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:19.430
Go see Kouki-sama when you've finished your lunch break.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:24.570
For your information, you can ask people about me, but it will be futile.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.180
Don't expect you can pull me down that way.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:30.690
They say, "Even a skilled swimmer can drown."

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.800
Then make me drown.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:41.820
Whoa! What was that "friendly enemies" quarrel about?

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:42.770
Tan-tan.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.200
Wh-What is it?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:49.230
It's a bit early, but let's have lunch.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.370
You have a delicious-looking lunch again today.

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:01.270
Anjuu-sama, you're visiting us again?

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:07.340
Come now. In this Imperial Court full of men,
this is the only place I can be alone with a girl.

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.100
Tan-tan's here too.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:12.730
You're right. That's my only cause for dissatisfaction.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:15.100
Excuse me, Anjuu-sama.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.280
Do you know anything about Riku Seiga?

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:22.030
Just between you and me...

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:24.950
Seiga is an illegitimate child of Kouki.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:25.390
What?

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:27.500
They have similar pelvises, you know.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.590
R-Really?!

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:30.970
No.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:34.930
How could an ordinary person tell if they have similar pelvises?

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:37.300
Anjuu-sama...

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:42.470
I told you to be careful, because I often lie.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.930
Try your best to get information out of me.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:51.560
Did Seiga always have an attitude like an alpha male monkey?

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:58.050
Why are you looking cross with me?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:01.020
You're not asking anything about <i>me.</i>

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:04.010
That's because Anjuu-sama's famous.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.110
Famous?

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:07.240
Where? What's the story?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.710
Do you want to know?

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:09.580
Sure.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.330
Then, what will you give me in return?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.250
You have me there.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.480
Fair enough. Just one.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.840
I'll tell you the truth about one thing, for real.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:28.910
Right now, does His Highness have many supporters beside him, or only a few?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.140
Only a few.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:35.370
His two closest advisers are making matters worse.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:41.980
Ran Shuuei and Ri Kouyuu have been away from the Emperor's side for a long time.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:46.780
Because this started soon after the appointment of Prime Minister Tei Yuushun,

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:50.790
people say that they disagreed about his appointment and had a conflict.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.060
Something like, "The Prime Minister has the Emperor's ear instead of us."

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.480
But that's-

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.910
Whether it's true or not doesn't matter.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.660
More importantly.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:03.750
they're acting carelessly and allowing
outsiders to draw conclusions like that.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:08.600
The absence of two young and highly successful officials from the Emperor's side...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.920
conveys a very negative impression.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.350
I understand. Thank you very much.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.390
So, what makes me famous?

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:23.160
You were famous for being a mysterious customer who concealed his name,

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.540
even though Kochou-nee-san tried to wheedle it out of you.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.240
How did you know?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.610
When I was about ten,

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:35.580
you stroked my head and said, "Will you keep me company when you grow up?"

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.280
Then you gave me a peach.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.280
You were the girl with an abacus in Kougarou!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:42.500
That's right.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.870
How wonderful. Isn't this fate?

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.720
The fate of being presented with a peach for sure.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.530
Oh.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:57.650
If you want to protect the Emperor, you should become strong.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.940
I'll help you when I feel like it.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:05.360
This is my first and last warning.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.280
If you see "him," run immediately.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.180
If he gives you something, give it back to him.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:13.530
The moment you receive a peach from him,
you won't be able to go back.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:15.540
A peach, you said?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.930
You've already received it?

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.590
Umm, yes...

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:22.730
All right then. Forget what I just told you.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.170
What?

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.780
We'll get back to work.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.920
Riku Seiga, Kou Shuurei.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.100
Yes, sir.
Yes, sir.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.760
I'm giving you an assignment.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:35.930
Kouki-sama, are you saying I have to work with her?

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.100
That's right.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.480
May I ask why?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.120
Why do you think you can't give this task to me alone?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.690
Because you're a man.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.440
Huh?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.910
Jyuusan-hime of the Ran family will be entering the Imperial Residence.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:53.700
Your mission is to discover the true objective behind the plan to assassinate Jyuusan-hime.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:57.250
The princess of the Ran family will be in the Imperial Residence?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:02.160
That means... you're sending her into the Imperial Residence as Jyuusan-hime's double?

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.750
Exactly.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:08.430
Even if you're from the Kou family, in here you're just an official.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.510
No one can replace Jyuusan-hime,

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.210
but there are plenty who can replace you.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.510
Sacrifice yourself to protect Jyuusan-hime,

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.520
and in the worst case, be prepared to die for her.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.450
I-I understand, sir.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.800
However, I won't die.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:27.050
I don't have time to die!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.390
Displeased?

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:32.310
Extremely displeased.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.830
You're so difficult.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:39.100
Anyway, I expect you to close the other case without delay.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:43.570
I know. I'll do it in my spare time. It's a trivial job.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:48.830
That's right. I don't have the time to die obediently!

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.470
Let's work hard!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:58.550
A double... to protect Ryuuki's wife, huh?

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:03.570
I wonder what Ryuuki would think if he heard about this?

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.510
Does he really mean to let his sister marry the Emperor?!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:15.460
That perpetual airhead! What's he planning to do?!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:19.750
If it bothers you, why don't you go see the Emperor or someone else?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.400
Do you realize what people say about you at the Imperial Court?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.000
I know!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.060
But in this state,

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.140
how am I supposed to go anywhere?!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.920
Well, that's true...

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:33.880
Maybe he doesn't like Yuushun paying so much attention to the Emperor,

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:39.060
or he doesn't want to send you to the Emperor, or perhaps both.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:49.790
I'm tied down by Reishin-sama and by the Kou family, so I can't take any action.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.880
He's tied down by the Ran family.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:57.930
Besides, he takes pride in the name of Ran. It must be even more difficult for him.

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:05.920
Riou.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.090
What is it? I'm working right now.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:12.340
Can I borrow your brain for a while?

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:22.410
What will happen if I reject the princess of the Ran family?

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.840
You will lose your vassals' respect.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.770
It will look like you turned down
an exceptional offer from the Ran family,

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.060
who rarely make concessions.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:35.510
On top of that, I've announced I'll be monogamous.

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:38.510
That would have made an admirable framework, indeed.

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:42.560
You'd say, "I've always waited for you and never married."

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.310
It would have been an ideal marriage.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:50.190
I don't understand it, but is love that important?

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:51.780
It's very important!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.380
It's the most important thing in the world!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:59.010
Kou Shuurei is already devoting her entire life to you.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.880
Instead of becoming one of your many lovers,

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:07.330
she wants to be your irreplaceable comrade, and nothing more.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.230
She's chosen to be by your side,

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:13.500
no matter what enemies she makes or whether she's the only one left.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.910
Can't you be satisfied with that?

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:21.950
Aren't you starting to take her for granted?

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.470
Everyone has limits.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:27.410
If you expect too much from her, even she will break down.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.560
You've said more than enough, Riou-kun.

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.220
Am I wrong?

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:39.820
Do you have a right to say whatever you want if it's not wrong?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.350
You have a point.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.620
Hey, you...

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.430
Yes?

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:50.580
If you aren't careful, you'll really get yourself killed one day.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.440
Unlike the Emperor, you can be replaced.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:56.690
Oh, do I have a shadow of death on my face?

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.800
Everyone dies some day.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:05.880
There's actually no real difference
whether it happens sooner or later.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.870
Hey, are you sure?

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:22.600
That assignment the Director General gave you requires quite a lot of preparation, doesn't it?

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:27.140
That's why I thought I'd better sort out as many things as possible now.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.060
Thief!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.290
Hold it right there!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.450
If you don't want it broken, then give back what you stole!

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:58.820
You were unlucky to steal that bag right in front of me.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.200
Now then.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:06.350
Money, money! My travel money was starting to run out.

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:09.280
E-Excuse me.

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:12.330
What? From your appearance, you're a civil servant, right?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.420
You arrived quickly!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.360
I mean, I'm not stealing from the thief!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.890
It's just a habit of mine.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:21.980
I mean, I meant to hand it over to the officer.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:31.450
Are you that Kou Shuurei-san everyone is talking about?

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:35.880
Huh? Yes, I am, though I don't know what people are saying about me.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.380
U-Umm...

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:42.290
You've great courage, to stand in front of that thief without a second thought!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.350
It's not an easy thing to do.

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.890
You're just as I imagined you'd be!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.890
Well, I'll see you again later!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.060
I don't quite understand, but please give this back too.

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:07.080
Even if it's the thief's purse, you can't steal it.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:11.410
Yes, ma'am. I'm sorry.

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:19.690
Please warn the woman whose bag was taken to be more careful next time.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:20.810
Bye then!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:27.680
Was that... a girl?

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:28.880
Yes...

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.690
She was incredible.

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:33.030
Not as incredible as you, though.

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.420
Are you going somewhere, Ran-shogun?

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.340
I'm going to meet my sister.

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:53.200
So, what's the matter?

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:57.070
I see you aren't carrying the iris-crested sword anymore.

00:21:57.070 --> 00:21:58.210
That's a comfort.

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:03.460
Which one will you choose, Ran-shogun?

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:08.300
The Ran family pretends to be ignorant whenever something goes wrong.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:10.220
When the Emperor's second prince was exiled,

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.080
and when the royal families fought over the succession,

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:14.790
the Kou and Ran families did nothing.

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:20.360
You pretend to be loyal, yet in bad times you say, "I cannot work for His Highness."

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:22.520
If it were me, I'd get rid of a vassal like that.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.360
Because he doesn't know where his loyalty truly lies,

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:30.360
he's even worse than a foe pretending to be a friend.

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:34.850
His Highness says he doesn't mind if you choose the Ran family.

00:22:35.820 --> 00:22:38.610
That's something I can't possibly say.

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:40.210
Anyway...

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:45.800
I'm not as kind as His Highness.

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:49.810
I don't care if you choose the Ran family.

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:52.930
In that case, just hurry back to Ranshuu.

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:58.080
But first you must surrender your honor, return the iris crest, and drop your pretense of loyalty.

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.940
Will you stop bullying my brother?

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:21.380
Jyuusan-hime...

00:24:45.320 --> 00:24:49.340
What kind of person is the Ran family's princess, Jyuusan-hime?

00:24:49.610 --> 00:24:53.190
She's been sent here to be Ryuuki's wife, right?

00:24:53.190 --> 00:24:54.890
There's no time to think about that.

00:24:54.890 --> 00:24:56.820
I'm just going to do my job!
